or Suparshva W291 project details, check out the description below.\n\n**Address:**  \nLocated in Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Suparshva W291 is positioned in one of South Mumbai’s most prestigious and elite residential neighbourhoods. This prime address is known for its scenic surroundings, heritage charm, and proximity to key commercial zones, reputed educational institutions, healthcare facilities, premium retail destinations, and seamless road connectivity, making it an ideal choice for refined city living.\n\n**Project Details:**  \nSuparshva W291 is developed on an approximate land parcel of 0.46 acres  \nSuparshva W291 features a premium residential tower with 22 storeys  \nSuparshva W291 offers well-planned 1 BHK and 2 BHK apartments  \nSuparshva W291 is designed to optimise space with efficient and practical layouts  \nSuparshva W291 focuses on comfortable homes suited for urban lifestyles in South Mumbai\n\n**Carpet Area:**  \nSuparshva W291 carpet area details are given below:  \n1 BHK - 490 sq.ft.  \n2 BHK - 705 sq.ft. to 813 sq.ft.\n\n**Lifestyle Amenities:**  \nJogging Track  \nKids Play Area\n\n**Facilities:**  \nLift  \nPower Back Up  \nParking Facility  \n24\\*7 Water Supply  \nGated Society  \nSecurity System\n\n**Why to Invest in this Property?**  \nExclusive Malabar Hill location with high prestige value  \nLimited new residential developments in South Mumbai  \nExcellent connectivity to key business and lifestyle hubs  \nTrusted developer with an established market presence  \nStrong long-term appreciation and rental demand potential\n\n**Possession & RERA:**  \nPossession Date: December 2031  \nMahaRERA Registration Number: P51900080495\n\n### Download Brochure\n\n## Pricing of Suparshva W291\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/publi